    "items": [
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "To the chief Musician upon Gittith, A Psalm for the sons of Korah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How amiable are thy tabernacles, O LORD of hosts!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My soul longeth, yea, even fainteth for the courts of the LORD:",
          "My heart and my flesh crieth out for the living God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Yea, the sparrow hath found an house, and the swallow a nest for herself, where she may lay her young,",
          "Even thine altars, O LORD of hosts, my King, and my God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Blessed are they that dwell in thy house:",
          "They will be still praising thee."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Blessed is the man whose strength is",
          "in thee; In whose heart are the ways of them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Who passing through the valley of Baca make it a well;",
          "The rain also filleth the pools."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They go from strength to strength,",
          "Every one of them in Zion appeareth before God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "O LORD God of hosts, hear my prayer:",
          "Give ear, O God of Jacob."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Behold, O God our shield,",
          "And look upon the face of thine anointed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For a day in thy courts",
          "Is better than a thousand.",
          "I had rather be a doorkeeper in the house of my God,",
          "Than to dwell in the tents of wickedness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the LORD God is a sun and shield:",
          "The LORD will give grace and glory: No good thing will he withhold from them that walk uprightly."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "O LORD of hosts,",
          "Blessed is the man that trusteth in thee."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
